Privacy Policy for NotGumtree
Effective Date: June 4, 2026

Thank you for choosing to be part of our community at NotGumtree ("we", "us", or "our"). We are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and share your information when you use our mobile application (the "App").

1. Information We Collect
We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when you register to become a seller on the App.

Personal Data:

Contact Information: Name, store name, phone number, and email address.

Location Data: We collect location information (suburb, city, province, country) only when you explicitly create a listing and assign a location to it. We do not continuously track your location in the background.

User-Generated Content (UGC): Text, pricing, and images associated with the classified adverts you post.

2. How We Use Your Information
We use the information we collect for the following purposes:

To Facilitate the Marketplace: To display your contact information and listings to potential buyers within the App.

Spam Prevention: We share your email address securely with a third-party service, Abstract API, exclusively during registration to verify email deliverability and block temporary/disposable spam accounts.

Safety and Moderation: To investigate user reports and flag/remove inappropriate User-Generated Content in compliance with Apple's App Review Guidelines.

3. How We Store Your Data (Apple CloudKit)
All user data and listings are stored securely using Apple's CloudKit infrastructure (iCloud.com.888jjm.NotGumtree).

We do not maintain a separate proprietary database for this App.

Your data benefits from the security and encryption standards provided natively by Apple.

4. Sharing Your Information
We only share your information in the following situations:

With Other Users: Buyers can view the contact information (name, store name, phone, email) you attach to a public listing.

With Essential Service Providers: As mentioned, your email is checked via Abstract API for verification purposes only.

Third-Party AI Disclaimer: We do not use, transmit, or share your personal data or user-generated content with any third-party Artificial Intelligence (AI) training models.

Legal Obligations: If required by law, we may disclose your information to comply with legal processes or law enforcement requests.

5. Data Deletion & Your Rights
You have the right to request the deletion of your personal data at any time.

In-App Deletion: You can delete your individual listings directly within the App.

Account Deletion: You can request the complete deletion of your seller profile and all associated adverts by contacting us. We will process and complete all data deletion requests within 30 days, in compliance with App Store requirements.

6. Children's Privacy
Our App requires users to be at least 12 years of age to access User-Generated Content. We do not knowingly collect data from children under this age. If we learn that personal information from a child has been collected, we will delete that data immediately.

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this privacy policy from time to time. The updated version will be indicated by an updated "Effective Date." We encourage you to review this privacy policy frequently to stay informed of how we are protecting your information.

8. Contact Us
If you have questions or comments about this notice, or wish to request data deletion, you may email us at:
